            "review_title": "Review at Marina Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Junie Huynh\n22 contributions\n0\nGood to recommend\nFeb 2026 • Friends\nDelicious food, friendly and supportive staff. The view was amazing to see Halong Bay.\nThe interior design is great and luxurious.\nWritten February 13, 2026\nChi N\nXin chao Trúc L,\n\nThank you very much for your kind review.\n\nWe are delighted to hear that you enjoyed the delicious food, the beautiful view of Ha Long Bay, and the luxurious interior design. It is also wonderful to know that our staff made your experience pleasant with their friendly and supportive service.\n\nYour recommendation means a great deal to us. We truly appreciate your support and look forward to welcoming you again in the future.\n\nSincerely,\nJesper Bach Larsen\n\nGeneral Manager\nInterContinental Halong Bay Resort\nRead more\nWritten March 5, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
