            "review_title": "Review at Marina Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Jesse I\nHong Kong, China4 contributions\n0\nHighly Recommend\nDec 2025 • Family\nOur family has enjoyed both breakfast and dinner at the restaurant. The food quality is at high standard and offers wide selections, satisfying appetite for both Eastern and Western flavors. Staff are very well trained and enthusiastic, especially Ms Nhu who has offered us great assistance during our meal there. We are very satisfied with our experiences at the restaurant and would definitely recommend it to other guests.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 30, 2025\nChi N\nXin chao 721jessei,\n\nThank you very much for your kind recommendation and for sharing your family’s experience with us.\n\nWe are truly delighted to know that you enjoyed both breakfast and dinner at our restaurant, and that the variety and quality of our offerings met your expectations for both Eastern and Western flavors. Your satisfaction is the greatest encouragement to our culinary and service teams.\n\nWe are especially grateful for your recognition of Ms. Nhu. Your thoughtful mention will certainly be shared with her, as it will mean a great deal to know that her assistance contributed positively to your dining experience.\n\nThank you once again for your recommendation. We sincerely look forward to welcoming you and your family back in the near future.\n\nSincerely,\nJesper Bach Larsen\n\nGeneral Manager\nInterContinental Halong Bay Resort\nRead more\nWritten February 12, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
